  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nAmount after 3 years = 4,800\n\nAmount after 4 years = 5,760\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nA = P(1 + r)ⁿ\n\nr = (A2 / A1) - 1\n\nP = A ÷ (1 + r)ⁿ\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ r = (5,760 ÷ 4,800) - 1\n\n⇒ r = 1.2 - 1\n\n⇒ r = 0.2 (20%)\n\n⇒ P = 4,800 ÷ (1 + 0.2)³\n\n⇒ P = 4,800 ÷ (1.2)³\n\n⇒ P = 4,800 ÷ 1.728\n\n⇒ P = 2,777.78\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 2,777.78.**",
